{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Bruhat 分解”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Bruhat分解"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Bruhat 分解是代数群及其"},{"Local":{"url":"旗簇","text":"旗流形"}},{"Plain":"的一个分解.</p>\n<h2>代数群</h2>\n<p>$$\r\nG = \\bigcup_{w\\in S_n} BwB\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>旗簇</h2>\n<p>抽象的旗簇 $\\mathrm{Fl}$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Borel子群","text":"Borel 子群"}},{"Plain":"的模空间.</p>\n<p>固定一个 Borel 子群 $B$, 有一个同构 $G/B\\to \\mathrm{Fl}$, $x \\mapsto xBx^{-1}$.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathrm{Fl} \\simeq G/B = \\bigcup_{w\\in W} BwB/B\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}